  <data name="LanguageName" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>English</value>
    <comment>The language name in that language. The string is never read at runtime; the file exists so MakePri sees one resource for this language. The manifest Resources element is generated from the qualifiers MakePri collected, and it collects those from this packaging project own PRIResource items only, not from the referenced app project and not from the merged .pri. Without these files the package declares English alone and the Store lists one supported language for an app that has thirty-three. The interface strings themselves are in Services/Strings.*.cs, compiled in rather than indexed here.</comment>
